{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8018","id":5221582218,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNzsFig","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8018","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8018.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8018.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8018","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8018/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8018/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8018/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/900178604da2d41ffc86127eed7ab4bfa9d45b81","number":8018,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(mcpx): GitHub identity failover for server auth (#7948)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Refs #7948 (queue task 14308). Follow-on: #8017.\n\n## What landed\n\n**`pkgs/mcpx/internal/mcpauth/failover.go`** — the identity-failover machinery for a server's auth block:\n\n- **Config**: `auth.failover.identities` — an ordered list of identities, each referenced by **secret name only** (no secret value in config, logs, or comments). Kind `app` = GitHub App (App ID + installation ID in config; PEM private key in the secret store); kind `token` = a stored token, so the single user token stays as the last entry / fallback and a bad App config cannot take the namespace down.\n- **Classification** (`Classify`): soft = HTTP 429, or 403 carrying rate-limit markers (primary/secondary limit text incl. \"submitted too quickly\", abuse detection, or a Retry-After). Hard = 401, marker-less 403, 404, 422, anything else — surfaces immediately with its real error, zero rotation.\n- **Rotator** (`Rotator.Do`): runs a call with the current identity; on a soft block it cools that identity down, logs the rotation (identity name + reason), persists state, and retries with the next identity — the caller sees success. Current identity + cooldowns persist in a state file, so they survive a github-server restart.\n- **Minter**: signs the App JWT (RS256, iss = App ID, 9-minute exp under GitHub's cap) and exchanges it for an installation token; tokens are cached in memory until near expiry, never persisted.\n- **Pool wiring** (`internal/pool`): a server whose auth block carries a failover list resolves the **current** identity's credential at connection start (bearer header, plus the auth block's declared env vars for stdio children). Servers without a failover block are byte-for-byte untouched.\n- **Docs**: `doc/fleet/mcp.md` github section + inventory row updated to the identity-list credential shape.\n- Session-facing tool surface unchanged (no tool names/counts touched).\n\n## Tests (named oracles, all passing on the laptop)\n\n- `TestSoftBlockFailsOverToSecondIdentity` — forced 429 and forced secondary-limit 403 on identity #1 both complete via identity #2; oracle = exact (identity, token) call sequence + rotation log line.\n- `TestHardBlockSurfacesImmediatelyWithNoRotation` — 401 / marker-less 403 / 404 / 422; oracle = exactly one call, zero rotation log lines, real error returned.\n- `TestRotationStateSurvivesRestart` — a second Rotator over the same state file reports the identical current identity and cooldown deadline.\n- `TestMintInstallationToken` — fake API; oracle = request path, JWT iss/lifetime, returned token.\n- `TestAppIdentityMintsAndCaches`, `TestAllIdentitiesSoftBlockedReturnsLastError`, `TestClassify` table.\n- `go test ./internal/mcpauth/ ./internal/pool/` pass; `go build ./...` clean. (`internal/config` has one failure, `TestServerKeysAnotherHostWritesAreRecordedNotRefused`, verified **pre-existing on clean main** faae727d5d — untouched by this PR.)\n\n## What remains (#8017)\n\nDaemon call-path wiring (translate a github tool result's embedded API soft block into `APIError`, run through `Rotator.Do`, respawn + retry mid-session) and live activation (enroll the App keys by name, add the failover block to the live github server config). #7948 stays open for that follow-on; this PR deliberately does not close it.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796808144&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8018&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8018&signature=7417637e9236c5931dc9f164bd42a2178646a2c5fa58f34e123cf2e9a13aeca3\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8018?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T09:22:20Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:23:14Z","closed_at":"2026-11-09T09:23:11Z","merged_at":"2026-11-09T09:23:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"f6d13def145206908e1226b7bb159eb4dd66a9e5","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[{"id":7767549,"node_id":"T_kwDOAZNvF84AdoX9","url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549","members_url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549/members{/member}","name":"codeowners","description":"Team Discussions: developing-today/code","permission":"pull","privacy":"closed","notification_setting":"notifications_enabled","html_url":"https://github.com/orgs/developing-today/teams/codeowners","repositories_url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549/repos","slug":"codeowners","type":"organization","organization_id":26439447,"parent":null}],"head":{"label":"developing-today:queue/14308-7948-mcpx-app-failover","ref":"queue/14308-7948-mcpx-app-failover","repo":{"id":627308783,"node_id":"R_kgDOJWP47w","name":"code","full_name":"developing-today/code","owner":{"login":"developing-today","id":26439447,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjI2NDM5NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26439447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.co